   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OUR SHARED OCEAN PROGRAMME 2022-2026 SECOND PAYM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our Shared Ocean is a multi-annual funding programme, and part of Ireland&#x2019;s response to the environmental and economic challenges facing many SIDS. It reflects our national commitment to establishing and growing closer ties with SIDS as described in A Better World, while also helping to deliver the SDGs. Our Shared Ocean will provide funding through annual competitive calls for projects within our three main themes; Oceans &amp; Climate, Inclusive and Sustainable Blue Economy &amp; Marine Policy and Ocean Governance.</narrative>
  </description>
